# openvela AI Skills Adapter

Use the existing openvela skill collection as the source of truth without duplicating it.

## Route

Select only the smallest relevant source skill, then read its `SKILL.md` completely before acting:

| Task | Source skill |
| --- | --- |
| Build, Kconfig, simulator, compile errors | `.claude/skills/openvela-build/SKILL.md` |
| First-time environment setup or repo sync | `.claude/skills/openvela-quickstart/SKILL.md` |
| NuttX driver implementation or board bring-up | `.claude/skills/nuttx-driver-development/SKILL.md` |
| Read-only driver quality review | `.claude/skills/driver-code-reviewer/SKILL.md` |
| Non-interactive `.config` edits | `.claude/skills/kconfig-tweak/SKILL.md` |
| ELF/map/binary size analysis | `.claude/skills/codesize/SKILL.md` |
| Heap/memdump analysis | `.claude/skills/memdump/SKILL.md` |
| PCM quality analysis | `.claude/skills/pcm-audio/SKILL.md` |
| Persistent terminal workflow | `.claude/skills/tmux/SKILL.md`; prefer Codex PTY sessions when sufficient |
| Submit an openvela PR | `.claude/skills/submit-pr/SKILL.md` |
| Contest session-log collection | `.claude/skills/contest-log-collector/SKILL.md` |

Resolve relative `scripts/`, `references/`, and `assets/` paths against the selected source skill directory.

## Codex compatibility

